<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-08T23:50:40.077Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 08 Nov 2026 23:50:40 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The junta bombed a health centre in Thailand's Tak province and struck Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, claiming resistance fire from Thailand, while resistance forces used drones to attack a Christian Bible school, killing three female students. An airstrike on a residence in Mrauk-U killed a pregnant woman and injured ten civilians, and the military is proceeding with April parliamentary by-elections in conflict-hit Sagaing, Chin and Shan, expanding voting to areas of ongoing fighting. The Tatmadaw delegation returned from Laos and a Myanmar delegation participated in the HADR‑2026 disaster-relief exercise, and dead Starlink terminals are being repurposed to locate and kill people. The UCDP recorded 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168729&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQb0lpX3RzbHh2d2c5YUxISjRoeVh3VExpRWptVERyLUtONkVmbWdvMWhvX3JYN0l5eEFNcTlTdWd4QXBybXNraERaWXZ4dm1KV1BrdVR0WFozblFBRVBDcDFjNlhxUlBtS19yd21HSEE0d0ttSDBNbldQQUNFU2tPbEhsQmlET3FCWUdCRHMzdmJUcWt5TEJXUDNZZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Melbourne Asia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxNbjBsN0xOVDB3by1TQjhyYmVVZm8tV05rWDNzQl9fU0Y4aUQ4ZXJqSlFnN0VoRkxOaW44Z0lVVlZ4djJVanZ6QjhucHl0UFN6VldtMGNvTGFub2pMY1poRkduUm5Jb0c1QmV5cnBfYWdWMnRncmdZbEVDMW1MZ09jN0t4T1VVaHVHX3NWcGpCbi1ENlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Melbourne Asia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxPbFR1VG1QZlVzRnRqcjhoaDBVQ1RZajVsTnZ0VEczR0ZGOGtmODFtWnJJSmJVZ1RPNmV4R09tbnoyOEgxdlZwYU9TMHZpOGVoeVRmUndOSFVzdnJaeHgxejQwYlZoT0FWMGJJeDhPSGtWMXF4RmJmaGRKUVZrOHUyWFExdFFMNkVzUGNUSkVZQlYzZndkdnk3Sw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Melbourne Asia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.